      "kind": "step",
      "title": "Check registrar availability across TLDs",
      "guidance": "Search the candidate names and required extensions at registrars that support them. Distinguish available registrations from resale listings, unavailable names and unsupported extensions. Capture the exact spelling, displayed price and observation time, then recheck ambiguous results with the registrar that would handle the purchase. Return the viable choices and restrictions for the cost comparison.",
