    {
      "id": "n3",
      "kind": "step",
      "title": "Shortlist candidates with pricing and renewal costs",
      "guidance": "Compare each shortlisted domain's registrar, registration term, initial price, renewal price, currency, extras and any resale quote. Use current renewal and transfer terms to calculate the ongoing cost after any introductory discount. Recommend a domain and registrar with the exact spending requirement, company ownership arrangement and person responsible for renewals.",
